### 3. Get All Products (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}

### 4. Get Product by ID (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/1

### Update an existing product (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "1",
  "name": "Updated Product Name",
